        "care": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Jewellery care",
            "icon": "sparkle",
            "content": "<ul><li>Put your jewellery on last, about 10 minutes after perfume, creams and sunscreen.</li><li>Take it off for the beach, the pool, hot showers, exercise and sleep.</li><li>Keep it away from detergents, alcohol gel, hair dye and anti-dandruff shampoo.</li><li>Wipe it with a soft, dry cloth after wearing. Don't soak pieces with stones.</li><li>Store each piece on its own, in a soft pouch, away from sun and heat.</li><li>Silver: wear it often, keep it in a sealed bag and use a polishing cloth for light tarnish.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping and returns",
            "icon": "truck",
            "content": "<p>Free Australia-wide shipping on orders over $149. Orders are shipped from Perth, Western Australia. Read our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">shipping policy</a> and <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">refund policy</a> for the details.</p>"
          }
