            "heading": "Authentic Rommanel",
            "icon": "medal",
            "content": "<p>Every piece we sell is original Rommanel jewellery from Brazil. Rommanel was founded in 1986 and is known for 18K gold-plated and 925 sterling silver jewellery.</p>"
